+the selected schema's own field is removed before JCS and SHA-256. Callers
+cannot choose an omit field. Verification recomputes that identity and refuses
+unsupported or malformed schema contracts, a missing or malformed selected
+self field, raw-byte `chunk_id` objects, mutable journal variants,
+self-included digests, duplicate keys, unsafe integers, and floating-point
+literals.
 
