event |\n6509|| &lt;code>RESUME-WORKSPACE&lt;/code> | Workspace-only prepare/commit, direct native state already current | Marker committed after direct activation; provider transaction remains none |\n6510|| &lt;code>RESUME-PROVIDER&lt;/code> | Provider-only prepared transaction | Null marker/path; provider transaction commits only after exact resume |\n6511|| &lt;code>RESUME-COMPOSITE-DIRECT&lt;/code> | Workspace plus portable provider | Both roots prepared; exact provider running before finalize cleans backups |\n6512|| &lt;code>RESUME-TASK-BOARD&lt;/code> | Task-board-only bundle | Journal opened → adopted → resumed; null marker/path |\n6513|| &lt;code>RESUME-COMPOSITE-TB&lt;/code> | Workspace plus bundle | Workspace remains rollbackable until bridge resume proof; then marker/finalize |\n6514|| &lt;code>RESUME-PRE-ACTIVATION-NEG&lt;/code> | Any prepared path fails validation | Roll back and remain stopped owner |\n6515|| &lt;code>RESUME-POST-ACTIVATION-NEG&lt;/code> | Activation succeeds, response/finalize fails | Status-recover/finalize or explicitly stop; never roll back behind live activation |\n6516|\n6517|It MUST not create a new native session under the old logical identity.\n6518|Antigravity backend &lt;code>not found&lt;/code> is\n6519|&lt;code>unsupported_backend_identity&lt;/code>, not a successful blank resume.\n6520|\n6521|### 13.11 Reboot restore\n6522|\n6523|On wrapper/service restore:\n6524|\n6525|1. rebuild or validate the local derived index;\n6526|2. inspect every previously running/idle local session;\n6527|3. refresh lease heads when peers are reachable;\n6528|4. mark losing local processes stale;\n6529|5. for winning local owners, validate the newest checkpoint and persisted\n6530|   profile;\n6531|6. recreate tmux wrapper panes or native Windows ConPTY wrappers; and\n6532|7. auto-resume only sessions whose configuration explicitly enables\n6533|   &lt;code>restore.auto_resume&lt;/code> and whose provider safe-stop/restore gate\n6534|   pass